      "id": "recovery",
      "status": "implemented",
      "summary": "Explicit version 2 operator grants enable encrypted bounded agent recovery and cross-process accounting. Native persistence is Linux AMD64 only. Durable inputs are text/none; result defaults and durable MCP calls are rejected. Uncertain dispatch fails closed; no exactly-once external-effect guarantee.",
